    "body": "In regards to the [GCloud configuration documentation](https://starship.rs/config/#gcloud), it is shown, if either of the `~/.config/gcloud/active_config` file, the `~/.config/gcloud/configurations/config_{CONFIG NAME}` file or the `CLOUDSDK_CONFIG` env var exists.\r\n\r\nEither check for one of those three and remove them, or disable the `GCloud` module by running `starship config glcoud.disabled true` in your shell.",
